OL,3,ADutch police offer record bB,2m reward
OL,4,Ain hunt for drug lord
OL,5,
OL,6,FDutch authorities have offered a record
OL,7,Faward of bB,2m (#1.7m/$2.24m) for
OL,8,Finformation leading to the arrest of
OL,9,FJos Leijdekkers, one of Europe's
OL,10,Fmost-wanted men.
OL,12,FThe 35-year-old, who is also known as
OL,13,FBolle Jos (Chubby Jos), was previously
OL,14,Faccused of being "one of the key
OL,15,Fplayers in international cocaine
OL,16,Ftrafficking" by Dutch police.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
