OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ADutch police offer record bB,2m reward
OL,4,Ain hunt for drug lord
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommenting on the decision to increase
OL,7,Fthe reward ten-fold, Dutch justice
OL,8,Fminister David van Weel said it was
OL,9,F"necessary given the threat that
OL,10,FLeijdekkers poses to national security,
OL,11,Four democratic rule of law, and the
OL,12,Finternational legal order".
OL,14,FDutch prosecutors said capturing
OL,15,FLeijdekkers was their "highest
OL,16,Fpriority" and any information shared
OL,17,Fwould be kept secret.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
